    "summary": "Bearer: a **GREY KNIGHTS** model.\n\nOnce per battle, during [your opponent's Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), as an enemy ranged attack targets the bearer's unit, you can take the bearer's unit off the battlefield and set it up again anywhere more than 8\" horizontally from every enemy unit. If that leaves it an ineligible target, your opponent can pick fresh targets for the attacks that were aimed at it.",
